Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.48,0:00:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:23.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making leaf-fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.67,0:00:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:36.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This one's a fish and this one's an octopus!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:41.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not a starfish?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:42.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.47,0:00:47.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh... S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.78,0:01:04.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Rin... Want this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.86,0:01:12.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! A fish book!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's a salmon! It has a lightly salted flavour!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.64,0:01:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think of them as food?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.72,0:01:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, it's a righteye flounder!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.17,0:01:34.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Righteye flounder?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That fish with both its eyes on the same side.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.50,0:01:37.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.05,0:01:40.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.19,0:01:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this one, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.11,0:01:45.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's like a blowfish, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.36,0:01:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I see it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.31,0:01:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:01.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.56,0:02:05.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:08.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean, cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.32,0:02:10.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Cutting them is cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This isn't cheating... It's called grown-up ingenuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.02,0:02:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! What should I do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.15,0:02:33.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're all eaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.91,0:02:40.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah! And there are holes in that acorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.37,0:02:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Holes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.74,0:02:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Must have been a bug...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.04,0:02:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:53.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, we've had that happen too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.60,0:02:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I made Reina cry when I told her she\Ncouldn't open them inside the house!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.74,0:03:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've got bugs coming out of these acorns...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,...and the leaves have been eaten away at.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.17,0:03:07.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Leaves?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.90,0:03:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We like to press them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.06,0:03:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pressed leaves, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm home!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:28.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, make sure you wash your hands first!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.65,0:03:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wait a sec!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.35,0:04:05.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, I'm leaving!
